          "range": {
            "startChar": 1404,
            "endChar": 1642
          },
          "text": "And if cognition is downstream of systemic inflammatory tone, then a molecule that repairs a physical barrier could plausibly out-perform a molecule that tries to top up a neurotransmitter precursor pool that was never actually depleted.",
          "voAssetId": "a_sp4_4e84d81a",
